        "TestLateResultAndCycleBoundaryPreserveLots in apps/api/internal/billing/billing_test.go (sweeper expires only held reservations past 30m TTL, never in_flight/reconciling; late provider result after released/expired quarantines output with zero customer debit; cycle boundary preserves purchased lots with expires_at IS NULL, computes 20% Pro/Business rollover once, retains in-flight holds on source lot, expires unused remainder from expired subscription lot upon late commit/release, and prevents duplicate monthly allocations on replay)"
      ]
    },
